review_notes = PackedStringArray("Draft implemented; narrative review pending (OD-01).", "Niketas's courtyard, the lamp and the visit are adaptation; the column, Hercules and the courtyard set up 7.9.", "REVIEW REQUIRED (OQ-07): the mosque and the fire. 7.5 follows Barbero's lecture (pilgrims set out to burn the mosque, Greeks defend their Muslim neighbours, the fire); docs/STORY.md 7.4 omits it. The contradiction stays open.")
